  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fBotany\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/b74a68ba-7878-4f63-8939-7763bd641272.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uZNu4db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"225\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br><br>結構工藝：塔樓</strong>為世界增添了沉浸式、基於生態域的主題塔樓，支援 Fabric/Forge/Quilt。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><br><strong>與傳送石碑相容。</strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">前哨站、防火塔、海底神殿柱、地獄與終界塔等。<br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jfGMW8rEAa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mxP6Z3i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/BotanyDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8Ui26tY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cWwoG5T.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bOLI9vp.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ANEELAC.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0k6kSh7.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XagtO2C.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<